New Buzz 6 App Update
Buzz 6 App Version V1.0.155
April 29th, 2025

Changes:

- Fixed a Crash Bug in VOD
- Fixed a bug with Last Seen on MAC Servers
- Added a workaround for missing TMDB info for movies and series which contain a language name in their names (e.g. "(English)")
- Fixed a bug when Device ID 1 and & would reset after user updates server info
- Added TMDB Support on VOD/TV Series for multiple system languages
- Fixed Next Episode Button in TV Series

